{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f1974c93d44668a2813fbe8d944368facaf33607f68e1cdd5df65cba1153c4e6", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\nそろそろ美也の着替えが終わるかな……？）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的日子。\n美也差不多该换好衣服了吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
