{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "f9c9c182e4b614f6b29ec7503cae343f7924bbd95d7b1b22442ab3c6d0d4de96", "ja": "はい～。ふふっ。{$P$}さんなら、\n分かってくれると思ってました～♪", "zh": "是呀～。呵呵，我就知道是{$P$}先生的话，您一定能明白～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "46be8ff4bbe253c2e7d8934c23d4dbcb6f697547fa188d4cdad7da210a8b9c83", "ja": "今日はいいお天気ですし、見た人も一緒に\nウキウキしてしまうような写真が撮りたいですな～。", "zh": "今天天气真好，我想拍出让看到的人也忍不住一起兴奋起来的照片呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d65f1e62ce3ef61a7f802b6c1a53229afd721efe86e328a4949aa348620c4bc6", "ja": "お、いいじゃないか！\n他にもアイディアがあれば、聞いてみるけど……。", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！要是还有其他点子，我也可以听听看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "7b85e6c1b4a4d75e128a028b328f2760f8ef89ecd2a95b368979442ac115f1c4", "ja": "他にですか～？　う～ん……そうですね～。\nたとえば、のんびり空をお散歩してみるとか。", "zh": "还有别的吗～？嗯……让我想想～。\n比如说，悠闲地在空中散散步之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "a1439d77c29f174cb2b2ada7893f21318f719624e35f1b4f910aded5ed901199", "ja": "雲のようにゆっくりと……。風船をたくさん持ったら、\n飛んでるようにみえるかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "像云朵一样慢慢地……要是拿着好多气球，说不定看起来就像在飞呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1011_p", "source_sha256": "650a48f0290fb46627f418f33e6e3db7811bfbcacf52e07fec508e77472139ff", "ja": "それは面白そうだな。\nただ、今から用意をすると、少し時間が掛かるかも。", "zh": "听起来挺有意思的。\n不过现在开始准备的话，可能要花点时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0343_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "bd62558c08c2970601c41f09d2cc80c7b1aa4394a31b48b7c125c2127cdfbfb2", "ja": "そうですか……。それなら、空に向かって\nおっきくジャンプ～……なんて、どうでしょう～？", "zh": "这样啊……那样的话，朝着天空高高跳起来～……怎么样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
